ass=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph LR&#10;    A[Compute: 发射新粒子] --&gt; B[Compute: 物理模拟]&#10;    B --&gt; C[Compute: 生死判定]&#10;    C --&gt; D[Compute: 紧凑化]&#10;    D --&gt; E[Indirect: 设置绘制参数]&#10;    E --&gt; F[Render: 实例化绘制]&#10;    subgraph GPU 计算&#10;        A&#10;        B&#10;        C&#10;        D&#10;        E&#10;    end\">graph LR\n    A[Compute: 发射新粒子] --&gt; B[Compute: 物理模拟]\n    B --&gt; C[Compute: 生死判定]\n    C --&gt; D[Compute: 紧凑化]\n    D --&gt; E[Indirect: 设置绘制参数]\n    E --&gt; F[Render: 实例化绘制]\n    subgraph GPU 计算\n        A\n        B\n        C\n        D\n        E\n    end</pre><p>GPU 粒子使用 Storage Buffer 存储粒子数据，通过 Compute Shader Dispatch 并行处理。间接绘制（Indirect Draw）读取 GPU 端计算出的活跃粒子数作为绘制实例数，完全避免 GPU→CPU 的数据回读：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"typescript\" data-code=\"const particleBuffer = device.createBuffer({&#10;  size: maxParticles * particleStride,&#10;  usage: GPUBufferUsage.STORAGE | GPUBufferUsage.VERTEX,&#10;});&#10;&#10;const counterBuffer = device.createBuffer({&#10;  size: 16,&#10;  usage: GPUBufferUsage.STORAGE | GPUBufferUsage.INDIRECT,&#10;});&#10;&#10;const computePass = encoder.beginComputePass();&#10;&#10;computePass.setPipeline(emitPipeline);&#10;computePass.setBindGroup(0, emitBindGroup);&#10;computePass.dispatchWorkgroups(Math.ceil(emitCount / 64));&#10;&#10;computePass.setPipeline(simulatePipeline);&#10;computePass.setBindGroup(0, simulateBindGroup);&#10;computePass.dispatchWorkgroups(Math.ceil(maxParticles / 256));&#10;&#10;computePass.end();&#10;&#10;const renderPass = encoder.beginRenderPass(renderPassDescriptor);&#10;renderPass.setPipeline(particleRenderPipeline);&#10;renderPass.setVertexBuffer(0, quadVertexBuffer);&#10;renderPass.setVertexBuffer(1, particleBuffer);&#10;renderPass.drawIndirect(counterBuffer, 0);&#10;renderPass.end();\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> particleBuffer</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> device.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">createBuffer</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">({</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  size: maxParticles </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">*</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> particleStride,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  usage: GPUBufferUsage.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">STORAGE</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> |</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> GPUBufferUsage.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">VERTEX</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">});</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> counterBuffer</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> device.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">createBuffer</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">({</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  size: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">16</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  usage: GPUBufferUsage.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">STORAGE</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> |</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> GPUBufferUsage.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">INDIRECT</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">});</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> computePass</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> encoder.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">beginComputePass</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">();</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">computePass.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">setPipeline</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(emitPipeline);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">computePass.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">setBindGroup</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">0</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, emitBindGroup);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">computePass.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">dispatchWorkgroups</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(Math.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">ceil</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(emitCount </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">/</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 64</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">));</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">computePass.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">setPipeline</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(simulatePipeline);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">computePass.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">setBindGroup</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">0</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, simulateBindGroup);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">computePass.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">dispatchWorkgroups</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(Math.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">ceil</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(maxParticles </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">/</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 256</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">));</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">computePass.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">end</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">();</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> renderPass</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> encoder.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">beginRenderPass</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(renderPassDescriptor);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">renderPass.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">setPipeline</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(particleRenderPipeline);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">renderPass.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">setVertexBuffer</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">0</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, quadVertexBuffer);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">renderPass.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">setVertexBuffer</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">1</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, particleBuffer);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">renderPass.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">drawIndirect</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(counterBuffer, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">0</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">renderPass.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">end</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">();</span></span></code></pre></div><p>GPU 粒子系统的一个关键挑战是原子操作和内存管理。发射新粒子需要在空闲列表中原子地分配槽位，回收死亡粒子需要原子地归还槽位。WebGPU 的 <code>atomicAdd</code> 和 <code>atomicCompareExchangeWeak</code> 提供了必要的同步原语。</p>\n<h2 id=\"billboard-渲染与排序\">Billboard 渲染与排序</h2><p>粒子渲染最常用的技术是 Billboard——将每个粒子渲染为一个始终面向相机的四边形。Billboard 矩阵通过相机的右向量和上向量构建，确保四边形始终正对观察者。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>Billboard 类型</th>\n<th>朝向方式</th>\n<th>适用粒子</th>\n<th>计算量</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>视点朝向</td>\n<td>始终面向相机位置</td>\n<td>爆炸、烟雾</td>\n<td>低</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>屏幕对齐</td>\n<td>平行于近裁剪面</td>\n<td>HUD 粒子</td>\n<td>最低</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>速度对齐</td>\n<td>沿运动方向拉伸</td>\n<td>火花、雨滴</td>\n<td>中</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>轴约束</td>\n<td>绕固定轴旋转</td>\n<td>草、树叶</td>\n<td>低</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>速度对齐 Billboard 将粒子沿速度方向拉伸，非常适合表现高速运动的火花和弹道轨迹：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"glsl\" data-code=\"#version 450&#10;&#10;layout(set = 0, binding = 0) uniform CameraData {&#10;    mat4 viewProjection;&#10;    vec3 cameraRight;&#10;    vec3 cameraUp;&#10;    vec3 cameraPos;&#10;};&#10;&#10;layout(location = 0) in vec2 quadVertex;&#10;layout(location = 1) in vec3 particlePos;&#10;layout(location = 2) in vec3 particleVel;&#10;layout(location = 3) in float particleSize;&#10;layout(location = 4) in vec4 particleColor;&#10;&#10;layout(location = 0) out vec2 texCoord;&#10;layout(location = 1) out vec4 color;&#10;&#10;void main() {&#10;    vec3 velocity = particleVel;&#10;    float speed = length(velocity);&#10;&#10;    vec3 forward;&#10;    vec3 right;&#10;    if (speed &gt; 0.001) {&#10;        forward = normalize(velocity);&#10;        right = normalize(cross(forward, cameraPos - particlePos));&#10;    } else {&#10;        right = cameraRight;&#10;        forward = cameraUp;&#10;    }&#10;&#10;    float stretchFactor = 1.0 + speed * 0.1;&#10;    vec3 worldPos = particlePos&#10;        + right * quadVertex.x * particleSize&#10;        + forward * quadVertex.y * particleSize * stretchFactor;&#10;&#10;    gl_Position = viewProjection * vec4(worldPos, 1.0);&#10;    texCoord = quadVertex * 0.5 + 0.5;&#10;    color = particleColor;&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>#version 450</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>layout(set = 0, binding = 0) uniform CameraData {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    mat4 viewProjection;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    vec3 cameraRight;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    vec3 cameraUp;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    vec3 cameraPos;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>};</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>layout(location = 0) in vec2 quadVertex;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>layout(location = 1) in vec3 particlePos;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>layout(location = 2) in vec3 particleVel;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>layout(location = 3) in float particleSize;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>layout(location = 4) in vec4 particleColor;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>layout(location = 0) out vec2 texCoord;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>layout(location = 1) out vec4 color;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>void main() {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    vec3 velocity = particleVel;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    float speed = length(velocity);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    vec3 forward;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    vec3 right;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    if (speed > 0.001) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        forward = normalize(velocity);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        right = normalize(cross(forward, cameraPos - particlePos));</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    } else {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        right = cameraRight;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        forward = cameraUp;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    float stretchFactor = 1.0 + speed * 0.1;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    vec3 worldPos = particlePos</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        + right * quadVertex.x * particleSize</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        + forward * quadVertex.y * particleSize * stretchFactor;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    gl_Position = viewProjection * vec4(worldPos, 1.0);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    texCoord = quadVertex * 0.5 + 0.5;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    color = particleColor;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}</span></span></code></pre></div><p>半透明粒子的排序是粒子渲染的经典难题。正确的混合要求从后向前绘制，但对数十万粒子进行排序代价高昂。常用的折中方案包括：加法混合（无需排序）、预乘 Alpha 混合（降低排序敏感度）、以及使用 OIT（Order-Independent Transparency）技术。</p>\n<h2 id=\"视觉特效合成\">视觉特效合成</h2><p>完整的游戏特效通常由多个粒子系统和其他视觉元素（光源、Decal、屏幕扭曲）组合而成。例如一个爆炸效果可能包含：闪光粒子、碎片粒子、烟雾粒子、冲击波扭曲、动态点光源和屏幕震动。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;    A[爆炸特效] --&gt; B[核心闪光]&#10;    A --&gt; C[碎片飞射]&#10;    A --&gt; D[烟雾扩散]&#10;    A --&gt; E[冲击波]&#10;    A --&gt; F[动态光源]&#10;    B --&gt; G[加法混合粒子]&#10;    C --&gt; H[网格实例化粒子]&#10;    D --&gt; I[Billboard 粒子]&#10;    E --&gt; J[屏幕空间扭曲]&#10;    F --&gt; K[衰减点光源]\">graph TD\n    A[爆炸特效] --&gt; B[核心闪光]\n    A --&gt; C[碎片飞射]\n    A --&gt; D[烟雾扩散]\n    A --&gt; E[冲击波]\n    A --&gt; F[动态光源]\n    B --&gt; G[加法混合粒子]\n    C --&gt; H[网格实例化粒子]\n    D --&gt; I[Billboard 粒子]\n    E --&gt; J[屏幕空间扭曲]\n    F --&gt; K[衰减点光源]</pre><p>屏幕空间扭曲（Screen Space Distortion）通过偏移 UV 采样坐标来模拟热浪、冲击波等折射效果。实现方式是在后处理阶段读取扭曲法线贴图（通常由粒子写入的独立 Render Target 提供），将其转化为 UV 偏移量并对颜色缓冲重新采样。</p>\n<p>Decal 系统将纹理投影到场景表面，用于弹孔、血迹、法阵等效果。延迟贴花（Deferred Decal）在 G-Buffer 阶段将贴花信息写入 Albedo 和法线缓冲，与场景几何完美贴合。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"mindmap\" data-source=\"mindmap&#10;  root((粒子与特效))&#10;    粒子系统&#10;      生命周期管理&#10;      对象池回收&#10;      发射器形状&#10;    GPU 粒子&#10;      Compute Shader&#10;      间接绘制&#10;      原子操作&#10;    粒子渲染&#10;      Billboard 朝向&#10;      速度拉伸&#10;      排序与混合&#10;    特效合成&#10;      多系统组合&#10;      屏幕扭曲&#10;      Deferred Decal\">mindmap\n  root((粒子与特效))\n    粒子系统\n      生命周期管理\n      对象池回收\n      发射器形状\n    GPU 粒子\n      Compute Shader\n      间接绘制\n      原子操作\n    粒子渲染\n      Billboard 朝向\n      速度拉伸\n      排序与混合\n    特效合成\n      多系统组合\n      屏幕扭曲\n      Deferred Decal</pre><ul>\n<li>粒子系统通过大量简单实体的集体行为模拟复杂视觉效果，是游戏特效的核心技术</li>\n<li>对象池和环形缓冲避免运行时内存分配，是粒子生命周期管理的标准方案</li>\n<li>GPU 粒子系统通过 Compute Shader 并行更新数百万粒子，间接绘制避免 GPU→CPU 数据回读</li>\n<li>Billboard 渲染使粒子始终面向相机，速度对齐拉伸适合表现高速运动效果</li>\n<li>半透明排序是粒子渲染的经典难题，加法混合和 OIT 是常用的折中方案</li>\n<li>完整特效由粒子、光源、Decal、屏幕扭曲等多种元素协同构成</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"粒子系统与视觉特效","id":"粒子系统与视觉特效"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"粒子生命周期管理","id":"粒子生命周期管理"},{"level":2,"text":"GPU 粒子系统","id":"gpu-粒子系统"},{"level":2,"text":"Billboard 渲染与排序","id":"billboard-渲染与排序"},{"level":2,"text":"视觉特效合成","id":"视觉特效合成"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"后处理管线","url":"/l-doc-books/h/game-development/game-graphics/post-processing/post-processing-pipeline"},"next":{"title":"屏幕空间效果","url":"/l-doc-books/h/game-development/game-graphics/post-processing/screen-space-effects"}}